  <header class="page-head">
    <h1>Teaching</h1>
    <p class="lede">I teach design as a way of changing what people do, not only what they see.
       Timetables, syllabi and materials are on the
       <a href="{{ site.unipa }}">University of Palermo website</a>, which is kept up to date every year.</p>
  </header>

