  <section class="sec" aria-labelledby="master">
    <div class="label">
      <h2 id="master">Master's in Interaction Design UX/UI</h2>
    </div>
    <div class="body">
      <p>I am Deputy Coordinator of the University of Palermo's first-level Master's in Interaction
         Design UX/UI, where I also teach and sit on the scientific committee. Its teaching notes,
         <a href="https://www.adi-design.org/2026_r00658">Instant Handbook</a>, were selected for the
         ADI Design Index 2026.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="sec" aria-labelledby="approach">
    <div class="label">
      <h2 id="approach">How I teach</h2>
    </div>
    <div class="body">
      <p>Students work on real briefs with a <strong>social and environmental impact</strong>, for
         organisations that face those problems every day, and learn from each other as much as from
         me. Generative AI is part of the studio, used as a tool to argue with rather than a shortcut.
         Teaching is also a subject of my research:</p>
      <ul>
        <li><a href="https://doi.org/10.21125/edulearn.2025.0988">Advancing Design Education: Integrating
            Service Design, Peer Mentoring and Generative AI in Project-Based Learning</a> (EDULEARN25, 2025)</li>
        <li><a href="https://doi.org/10.54941/ahfe1004537">Designing the Future: A Manifesto for Design
            Education</a> (IHSI 2024)</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="sec" aria-labelledby="theses">
    <div class="label">
      <h2 id="theses">Theses and doctoral research</h2>
    </div>
    <div class="body">
      <p>I am a member of the doctoral board of the PhD in Architecture, Arts and Planning. If you want
         to write a thesis or a doctoral proposal on behaviour change, games, generative AI in design,
         or participation in cities, <a href="mailto:{{ site.email }}">write to me</a> with a page on what
         you would like to study.</p>
    </div>
  </section>
